# host could move.

/github        https://github.com/AreteAcademy/brevis            302
/repo          https://github.com/AreteAcademy/brevis            302
/issues        https://github.com/AreteAcademy/brevis/issues     302
/discussions   https://github.com/AreteAcademy/brevis/discussions 302
/sdk           https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/AreteAcademy/brevis/sdk 302
/arete         https://areteacademy.com.br/                      302

# The old flat paths, from before /docs existed.
/documentacao  /pt/docs/    301
/documentation /docs/       301

# English moved from /en to the root when it became the default language.
/en            /            301
/en/*          /:splat      301
